  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of line joining the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>.</p><p>If this line is tangent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math> should have equal roots.&nbsp;</p><p>Thus, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> No value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></math></p>",
